{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0294_1000_p", "source_sha256": "57b8b8473b0d78ea3200cc5a7581f6cd5e1cf587d9e2b56a8e5e8b432696211f", "ja": "（今日は麗花のライブ当日。本人の希望で、予定の\n時間よりも、だいぶ早く会場に来たのだが……）", "zh": "（今天是丽花的演唱会当天。应她本人的要求，我们比预定时间早了很多来到会场，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0294_1001_048rei", "source_sha256": "9908935c26da634cfc59aafec59241e97865c33b89485dfff7a94b6b6772573c", "ja": "わぁー、見てください{$P$}さん！\n素敵なキャンプ場ですね！　うーん、空気も美味しい！", "zh": "哇——，您看{$P$}先生！  \n真是个棒极了的露营地呢！嗯——空气也很清新！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0294_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f6c9b61a1a25cae03c84a9f55ef987403399ef1255cd1c02dbf1de9b929ce0ea", "ja": "そうだな、アウトドアならではのライブになりそうだ。\n麗花の衣装も雰囲気と合ってるし。", "zh": "是啊，看来会是一场只有户外才能办到的演出。\n丽花的服装也和这里的氛围很搭。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0294_1003_p", "source_sha256": "091ffb26fdc9984be0e8e598503320295e880bae190c0208e3351c189daf8a52", "ja": "ところで、どうしてこんなに早く会場入りしたんだ？", "zh": "对了，为什么这么早就到会场了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0294_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "b6b22e6d3c70d065644d298a7bc50c0adc3dc4b32f5a27603fe764fe80378e89", "ja": "もちろん、周辺をチェックするためですよ？\n会場の外は、どれくらい走り回れるのかとか……。", "zh": "当然是为了检查周边情况呀？\n比如会场外面能跑多大范围之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0294_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "f322b0a6fe7ee39bec257e9515eb8a7ea6366666efebdb726ffb7ad97495ae46", "ja": "アウトドアもライブも、ちゃんと\n事前の準備をするのが大切なんですよ！　えっへん♪", "zh": "不管是户外活动还是演唱会，事先做好充分准备都很重要哦！得意♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0294_1006_p", "source_sha256": "d40452f0761e0b8c946b8fffd07af1ad8df612ffa2002bea032102d3f4fcdced", "ja": "外を走り回る事はないと思うけど……\n確かに、事前の準備は大事だな。", "zh": "虽然我觉得应该不用在外面到处跑……\n但事先做好准备确实很重要呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0294_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "8d2125550a3c6e0f29667433be920cba73f90c38293b316d2d900491686039f4", "ja": "なので、衣装以外も色々もってきました！　水筒に\nヘッドライト、招き猫、カメラにコンパスと地図……。", "zh": "所以，除了服装以外，我还带来了各种各样的东西！水壶、头灯、招财猫、相机，还有指南针和地图……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0294_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "b7f093806ce4637bbb68bc36199eec53b7a1410bce4f6c02bb64d2eba530dc35", "ja": "{$P$}さんが山で迷子になっても、\nちゃんと助けにいけますよ♪", "zh": "就算{$P$}先生在山里迷路，\n我也能好好去救你哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0294_1009_p", "source_sha256": "9a80809f350aab8e3c1b51d6d44c9ba77252ef6a3d914e8bc5142bdf0780cb78", "ja": "朝、やたら大きなザックを背負っていたのは、\nそういう事だったのか……。", "zh": "早上背着那么大的背包，\n原来是这么回事啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0294_1010_p", "source_sha256": "db63961143f87f1afab5ec4ebb3557e2d1c9173f7ea9fdf655469bdb67214844", "ja": "けど、麗花でも地図を見たりするんだな。\n気分でコースを決めるタイプなのかと思ってたよ。", "zh": "不过，没想到连丽花也会看地图啊。\n我还以为她是那种凭心情决定路线的人呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0294_1011_048rei", "source_sha256": "1a350fda700898316b2f8bb37592f4618c70b229a4f86eff8488a524a2ca151d", "ja": "ええっ！？　{$P$}さん、どうして\nわかったんですか？　もしかして、占い師さん？", "zh": "诶！？　{$P$}先生，您是怎么知道的？\n难道您是占卜师？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0294_1012_048rei", "source_sha256": "451ab08895c810a78477ab19e760193d929ab36cff1b98f32fccfd2e45199e4f", "ja": "たしかに、私は気分でるんるーん♪って登山する\nタイプですけど。ビギナーさんには危ないですよ？", "zh": "确实，我是那种一时兴起就哼着歌♪去爬山的人。不过对新手来说很危险哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0294_1013_048rei", "source_sha256": "a492d9243f7eb4346ecd717378d1515eef695440d2a14bbec4cbf38641e989f2", "ja": "慣れないうちはちゃんと地図を見て、目的地とルートを\n決めてから、るんるーん♪と登山しましょう！", "zh": "刚开始还不熟悉的时候，要好好看地图，确定目的地和路线之后，再哼着歌♪去登山吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0294_1014_p", "source_sha256": "3c32b61054f0595cca51e422799ba5b2e1b35c1a00b72b799922febb8d38f9d2", "ja": "（すごいしっかりとした発言だ……！）", "zh": "（这番话说得真是有条有理……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0294_1015_p", "source_sha256": "3323523bf8d00759dc62060f0221e19fb9ff81352db252f1375cc37a7091b113", "ja": "わかった。それじゃライブの前に、\nしっかりと会場周辺を下見しておこうか。", "zh": "明白了。那在演出之前，\n先好好去会场周边踩个点吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0294_1016_048rei", "source_sha256": "d8858966faec5d0000297de382291eb5eebdba73a6d5d0cab262dc9b8aa07df7", "ja": "はーい♪\n私、登山はけっこう得意なほうですけど……。", "zh": "好♪  \n我挺擅长登山的，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0294_1017_048rei", "source_sha256": "334b3cccc0dc1e606eb845ba93e23038324859d44ae0aef30f6dd1ee21a48d36", "ja": "アイドルとしては、まだまだビギナーだと思うので。\n{$P$}さん、ガイドお願いしますね♪", "zh": "作为偶像，我觉得自己还只是个新手。\n{$P$}先生，请多多指导我哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0294_1018_p", "source_sha256": "be6ac83acfb560d657eb9e9acb5016652d619e0c07479094ca7ec756b54feeb5", "ja": "ああ、もちろんだ。麗花が立派なトップアイドルに\nなるまで、頑張ってガイドするよ！", "zh": "啊，当然。我会努力指导你，直到丽花成为出色的顶级偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0294_1019_048rei", "source_sha256": "aec3cc0780c6c0dc14cc85884a2cb6997c7c9e7080f5b706e4a1c8c9f013349d", "ja": "それなら、アイドル山もバッチリ越えられますね！\n頂上目指して、がんばっちゃいましょう♪", "zh": "这样一来，偶像山也能顺利翻越了呢！\n朝着山顶，加油努力吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0294_1020_048rei", "source_sha256": "9c9da4d6e7348266a28494b0298d047dfb1e19ed8076a9195596b7b399ece99c", "ja": "それじゃあさっそく、会場周辺を見て回りますね！\nこの衣装、とっても動きやすいです♪", "zh": "那我马上去会场周边逛逛吧！\n这身服装穿起来特别方便活动♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0294_1021_p", "source_sha256": "9fb9785fa4a86a2b6681854453a89f403ae876ecd0eb6415ccece540e60a38b9", "ja": "あっ、麗花！　今、ガイドするって言ったのに……\nおーい、そんなに走ると転ぶぞー！", "zh": "啊，丽花！刚才还说要当向导的……\n喂——，跑那么快会摔跤的——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
